Package: xserver-xlibre-input-evdev-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends}
Multi-Arch: foreign
Description: XLibre X server -- evdev input driver (development headers)
 This package provides the development headers for the evdev input driver
 found in xserver-xlibre-input-evdev. Non-developers likely have little use
 for this package.
 .
 This package is built from the XLibre xf86-input-evdev driver module.
